{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/cuyj3a","slide":1,"text":"Presenter 1\n\nWelcome everyone. We are presenting Clarafin, a financial-document intelligence workspace designed for SMEs. The central idea is simple: turn scattered finance files into a clear, evidence-backed understanding of the business.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ox3rxg","slide":2,"title":"THE PROBLEM","textShapes":12}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jylcbqx4","slide":2,"text":"THE PROBLEM","textPreview":"THE PROBLEM","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[62,42,680,24]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzud4vy9","slide":2,"text":"Finance teams have the documents — but not a single, reliable view.","textPreview":"Finance teams have the documents — but not a single, reliable view.","textChars":67,"textLines":1,"bbox":[62,76,1090,62]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/l03ud0fu","slide":2,"bbox":[62,152,1156,2]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/atcve1g7","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1164,656,54,22]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/bulc76xs","slide":2,"bbox":[76,224,14,14]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wvudgbyd","slide":2,"text":"Scattered sources","textPreview":"Scattered sources","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,220,450,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xw3u9gfy","slide":2,"text":"Bank statements, P&L reports, invoices, and spreadsheets sit in different places.","textPreview":"Bank statements, P&L reports, invoices, and spreadsheets sit in different places.","textChars":81,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,253,450,52]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/upwva5gr","slide":2,"bbox":[76,355,14,14]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fq5wjaxw","slide":2,"text":"Manual interpretation","textPreview":"Manual interpretation","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,351,450,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/filsb2po","slide":2,"text":"Teams spend time reading files and reconciling clues instead of making decisions.","textPreview":"Teams spend time reading files and reconciling clues instead of making decisions.","textChars":81,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,384,450,52]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ehcbixo3","slide":2,"bbox":[76,486,14,14]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/143adc7u","slide":2,"text":"Uncertain conclusions","textPreview":"Uncertain conclusions","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,482,450,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0jutk769","slide":2,"text":"Without traceability, it is difficult to defend a metric or know what information is missing.","textPreview":"Without traceability, it is difficult to defend a metric or know what information is missing.","textChars":93,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,515,450,52]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/n6lcf2pk","slide":2,"bbox":[720,218,440,314]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/25cbmhof","slide":2,"text":"The gap","textPreview":"The gap","textChars":7,"textLines":1,"bbox":[762,255,260,32]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p8nuhc7q","slide":2,"text":"Raw financial files\nshould become\nclear decisions.","textPreview":"Raw financial files | should become | clear decisions.","textChars":50,"textLines":3,"bbox":[762,310,315,128]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o7uto765","slide":2,"text":"…without inventing figures.","textPreview":"…without inventing figures.","textChars":27,"textLines":1,"bbox":[762,463,300,28]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ox3rxg","slide":2,"text":"Presenter 1\n\nSmall and medium businesses often already possess the key financial records. The challenge is that the records are fragmented, analysis is manual, and conclusions are hard to validate. Clarafin focuses on the gap between having documents and having decision-ready insight.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
