{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/so68f7","slide":3,"text":"Presenter 1\n\nClarafin creates a structured flow from ingestion through reasoning to evidence. The important product principle is grounded analysis: when the documents do not support an answer, the product says so instead of guessing.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
