{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fvhgem","slide":4,"text":"Presenter 2\n\nThis is the end-to-end user journey. A user signs in, uploads documents, chooses the relevant set, and triggers analysis. The workspace then returns a clear review of the current state, gaps, risks, and the citations that support every finding.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
