{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/j4mhdj","slide":5,"text":"Presenter 2\n\nThe solution uses a React frontend for the workspace and a FastAPI backend for protected operations. Documents are parsed into usable content, routed through retrieval and context-building, and then sent to the AI analysis layer. SQLite stores the core application records.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
