{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/so9y4x","slide":6,"text":"Presenter 2\n\nThe ingestion layer is designed around practical finance formats: PDF, CSV, XLSX, and XLS. It validates file type and size, records ownership, and builds a catalog the user can review before analysis. This gives the agent the correct boundary for every run.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
