{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/4fd3lx","slide":7,"text":"Presenter 3\n\nThe AI is not asked to make up a financial story. It receives context built from the selected documents and is instructed to ground every metric and observation in those sources. A key safety rule is explicit: when the information is missing, the product tells the user what cannot be determined.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
