{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/sgob5i","slide":9,"text":"Presenter 3\n\nThe results screen organizes the output into four decision-focused areas: the current state, the gaps that stop us from being certain, forward-looking flags, and traceability. This helps users move from “what does this file say?” to “what should we review next?”\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
