{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/9kq6az","slide":10,"text":"Presenter 4\n\nThe technology choices prioritize speed of development and clarity. React and Vite give us a responsive frontend; FastAPI exposes typed APIs; SQLite keeps the prototype simple; and dedicated parsers support our document formats. The AI layer is configurable and can fall back gracefully when a key is unavailable.\n\n[Sources]\nProject repository: Clarafin README, frontend/src/App.jsx, backend/main.py, backend/database.py."}
